    "body": "Er, actually we have to pass a set consisting of only one element `url`, instead of an empty set, as the `visited set` parameter for top-level callers (here and in \"fetch a module worker script graph\"). Otherwise, \"internal module script graph fetching procedure\" can be called twice on the root URL.\r\n\r\n[Optional] Perhaps adding an assertion that the `url` is contained in the `visited set` in \"internal module script graph fetching procedure\" might be helpful to ensure the procedure is called only once per URL per root module script.",
    "created_at": "2017-09-05T22:32:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-06T19:49:46Z",
